John 12:1 , Jesus excuses Mary anointing his feet;
John 12:9 , The people flock to see Lazarus;
John 12:10 , The chief priests consult to kill him;
John 12:12 , Christ rides into Jerusalem;
John 12:20 , Greeks desire to see Jesus;
John 12:23 , He foretells his death;
John 12:37 , The Jews are generally blinded;
John 12:42 , yet many chief rulers believe, but do not confess him;
John 12:44 , therefore Jesus calls earnestly for confession of faith.
